WEBVTT

01:49.509 --> 01:54.910
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.960
[Episode 29]

01:58.070 --> 02:01.730
[Pure of Heart]

02:26.000 --> 02:27.329
Have you figured it out?

02:29.710 --> 02:30.520
Your Majesty,

02:31.630 --> 02:33.840
I've been working really hard,

02:34.360 --> 02:36.360
following your every order to the letter.

02:36.360 --> 02:37.360
For Great Jing

02:37.630 --> 02:38.750
and the people,

02:39.190 --> 02:40.720
I've always given it my all.

02:40.910 --> 02:41.840
I don't know

02:42.840 --> 02:45.079
what I've done wrong.

02:48.120 --> 02:49.150
Minister Yan,

02:49.560 --> 02:51.360
His Majesty has always forbidden

02:51.360 --> 02:53.420
forming factions for personal gain.

02:54.360 --> 02:56.020
Your Majesty, I've never done that!

02:56.020 --> 02:59.180
[Petition]

02:56.960 --> 02:58.220
Today, I'm not going to

02:59.590 --> 03:02.400
dig into your family's past.

03:02.840 --> 03:05.030
Who you once colluded with

03:05.430 --> 03:06.960
and what you did—

03:08.190 --> 03:09.250
it doesn't matter.

03:10.080 --> 03:11.430
What I care about

03:11.630 --> 03:15.810
[Petition]

03:12.750 --> 03:15.550
is the result of
tomorrow's joint interrogation.

03:16.600 --> 03:17.430
Tomorrow,

03:18.120 --> 03:20.320
the Pingrong Battle case will be heard.

03:20.750 --> 03:23.000
I'll handle it impartially

03:24.190 --> 03:26.450
and present Your Majesty with the truth.

03:27.710 --> 03:29.000
The Pingrong Battle

03:30.240 --> 03:31.840
was a tragedy for Great Jing.

03:32.590 --> 03:36.240
I do want justice for the people.

03:37.630 --> 03:38.240
But…

03:39.010 --> 03:39.790
[Memorial]

03:41.030 --> 03:43.520
it has to be the truth I want.

04:04.760 --> 04:05.890
Chancellor?

04:06.590 --> 04:07.430
You…

04:07.910 --> 04:09.360
Weren't you dead?

04:11.190 --> 04:12.590
Sorry to disappoint you.

04:12.850 --> 04:13.800
No, not at all.

04:13.980 --> 04:15.380
That's not what I meant.

04:17.000 --> 04:20.089
Ever since I heard the news of your death,

04:20.190 --> 04:22.550
I haven't had a full night's sleep.

04:22.800 --> 04:24.830
You guided me

04:24.830 --> 04:26.360
like a father.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.600
I've been

04:27.600 --> 04:28.600
devastated

04:28.600 --> 04:30.200
and overwhelmed with grief.

04:30.770 --> 04:32.300
I just wonder

04:33.000 --> 04:35.600
what brought you back

04:36.040 --> 04:37.830
and what all this is about.

04:44.040 --> 04:45.780
I want you

04:46.130 --> 04:48.350
to testify against the Seventh Prince.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.790
What are you trying to do?

05:00.300 --> 05:05.230
[Imperial Edict]

05:01.470 --> 05:03.800
His Majesty has ordered the Three Bureaus

05:04.040 --> 05:05.700
to investigate a murder case.

05:05.830 --> 05:06.820
Nan Heng

05:07.360 --> 05:09.240
is a suspect in this case!

05:10.430 --> 05:11.240
You,

05:11.530 --> 05:13.950
go get your master out here.

05:14.120 --> 05:16.040
He's coming with me
to the Ministry of Justice for trial.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.040
You're too late.

05:17.430 --> 05:18.760
Our general isn't here.

05:19.120 --> 05:19.920
Not here?

05:21.800 --> 05:22.860
Don't play tricks.

05:23.190 --> 05:24.190
Where did he go?

05:24.570 --> 05:25.990
The Ministry of Justice.

05:27.430 --> 05:29.830
He knew about
today's joint interrogation?

05:29.830 --> 05:32.110
There are no secrets under the sun.

05:35.070 --> 05:35.870
Fine then.

05:36.750 --> 05:38.409
Since he's turned himself in,

05:38.750 --> 05:40.620
it saves me the trouble.

05:41.190 --> 05:42.390
Before the general left,

05:42.390 --> 05:44.250
he asked me to tell you something.

05:46.120 --> 05:46.920
Go ahead.

05:47.890 --> 05:49.510
"If you want to frame someone,

05:49.510 --> 05:51.230
you'll always find a way."

05:55.300 --> 06:00.650
[Ministry of Justice]

05:58.120 --> 05:59.510
The joint interrogation today

05:59.510 --> 06:00.920
is actually for the Seventh Prince.

06:00.920 --> 06:02.000
What has he done?

06:02.800 --> 06:04.600
I heard that Capital Prefect Chu

06:04.600 --> 06:06.480
discovered evidence
that the Seventh Prince

06:06.480 --> 06:08.600
colluded with a traitor
during the Pingrong Battle.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.500
If the prince can't prove his innocence,

06:10.500 --> 06:12.170
he might lose his head.

06:13.540 --> 06:15.120
It's starting.

06:16.600 --> 06:17.630
They're not letting us watch.

06:17.030 --> 06:19.930
[Justice Brings Clarity]

06:34.680 --> 06:35.480
Nan Heng,

06:35.830 --> 06:37.390
as a murder suspect,

06:37.390 --> 06:38.830
you show no respect for the law,

06:38.830 --> 06:40.430
barging into the Ministry of Justice.

06:40.430 --> 06:41.720
What are you trying to do?

06:41.720 --> 06:42.550
Chu Guihong,

06:43.600 --> 06:45.000
as the capital prefect,

06:45.400 --> 06:47.130
you fabricated false evidence

06:48.120 --> 06:50.450
and forced confessions through torture.

06:51.010 --> 06:52.409
What are you trying to do?

06:54.750 --> 06:55.560
Nan Heng,

06:56.240 --> 06:58.970
where did these
bloodstained clothes come from?

07:00.640 --> 07:02.310
The celestial prison.

07:02.740 --> 07:06.580
[One hour ago]

07:11.940 --> 07:12.860
Yunlong.

07:13.810 --> 07:14.620
Shanhu.

07:15.950 --> 07:16.750
Chief.

07:17.720 --> 07:19.000
He tortured you?

07:19.750 --> 07:20.650
Barely a tickle.

07:20.650 --> 07:21.850
Don't worry about it.

07:22.310 --> 07:22.950
I'm fine.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.540
That idiot Chu Guihong

07:25.830 --> 07:27.150
isn't much of a threat.

07:31.990 --> 07:32.790
Don't worry.

07:33.950 --> 07:35.550
Anyone who hurts my brothers

07:35.800 --> 07:37.390
has to pay for it.

07:43.530 --> 07:45.409
Where are Yunlong and Shanhu?

07:46.240 --> 07:48.600
I've sent them to a clinic for treatment.

07:49.560 --> 07:50.920
You broke into the celestial prison,

07:50.920 --> 07:52.120
and freed prisoners.

07:52.240 --> 07:53.700
That's a capital offense.

07:54.710 --> 07:57.310
I won't run from any crime
I should be held responsible for.

07:57.310 --> 07:58.760
But you, Chu Guihong,

07:58.890 --> 08:00.090
fabricated evidence

08:00.120 --> 08:01.240
to frame me.

08:01.800 --> 08:04.010
I don't want any citizen of Great Jing

08:04.040 --> 08:06.040
to die because of schemes and plots.

08:08.800 --> 08:09.750
Ministers,

08:10.800 --> 08:12.260
the whole city is watching

08:12.480 --> 08:14.280
the joint interrogation today.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.020
If anyone

08:16.190 --> 08:19.190
dares to conceal the truth
about the Pingrong Battle,

08:19.430 --> 08:20.950
I'll execute them

08:20.980 --> 08:22.550
on the spot.

08:37.200 --> 08:38.030
Wake up.

08:38.200 --> 08:40.000
Your employer is here to get you.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.090
Why are you running?

08:46.630 --> 08:47.910
I'm not here for you.

08:51.150 --> 08:52.410
Nan Heng is in trouble.

08:54.940 --> 08:55.850
Mr. Chu,

08:56.200 --> 08:57.440
you accuse Nan Heng of ordering

08:57.440 --> 08:59.860
the assassination of Lu Yi,
a scout from the Qianyu Army.

08:59.860 --> 09:01.140
Do you have proof?

09:06.630 --> 09:09.190
After Nan Heng learned that
I found the traitor Lu Yi,

09:09.190 --> 09:11.120
he was afraid that I'd find out
he colluded with Lu Yi

09:11.120 --> 09:12.030
during the Pingrong Battle

09:12.030 --> 09:14.200
and concealed
the Qianyu Army's call for help.

09:14.200 --> 09:16.860
So he sent his men
Yunlong and Shanhu to kill him.

09:17.180 --> 09:19.660
[Statement of Po Yunlong
from Waning River Crescent]

09:18.230 --> 09:20.760
These are Yunlong
and Shanhu's confessions.

09:22.440 --> 09:24.500
Yunlong and Shanhu did not kill Lu Yi.

09:24.910 --> 09:25.910
This so-called evidence

09:25.910 --> 09:27.750
was forged by you, Chu Guihong.

09:28.230 --> 09:29.180
Those two

09:29.630 --> 09:31.760
were tortured by you into confessing.

09:31.960 --> 09:34.030
The blood-stained clothes are the proof.

09:34.030 --> 09:36.030
Ministers, if you don't believe me,

09:36.080 --> 09:37.630
you can summon them anytime

09:37.710 --> 09:39.270
for a face-to-face confrontation.

09:39.270 --> 09:40.510
They work for you.

09:41.210 --> 09:42.840
Naturally, they'll say whatever

09:42.840 --> 09:43.770
you tell them to.

09:45.060 --> 09:47.000
If, as you claim,

09:47.120 --> 09:49.070
they'll say whatever I tell them to,

09:49.070 --> 09:51.400
why would they have testified against me?

09:51.680 --> 09:53.390
That's enough to prove one of two things:

09:53.390 --> 09:54.150
either

09:54.150 --> 09:56.630
you forced
the confession through torture,

09:56.750 --> 09:57.550
or

09:57.790 --> 09:58.590
this evidence

09:59.240 --> 10:00.720
was made up by you.

10:15.960 --> 10:17.360
What are you looking for?

10:17.750 --> 10:18.550
Evidence.

10:19.490 --> 10:21.840
These are all letters
Chu Guihong wrote you.

10:21.840 --> 10:23.840
How would there be evidence in them?

10:29.270 --> 10:30.200
I found it.

10:30.960 --> 10:32.200
"That brat Nan Heng

10:32.320 --> 10:33.840
is now trapped in Youcheng.

10:33.840 --> 10:36.200
My father has placed spies around him.

10:37.000 --> 10:39.100
If he dares step out of line,

10:39.200 --> 10:40.660
he'll be punished."

10:43.600 --> 10:44.840
This letter

10:44.960 --> 10:47.760
was written five days
before the Pingrong Battle.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.750
Nan Heng's every move

10:49.750 --> 10:51.240
was being watched at that time.

10:51.240 --> 10:52.790
How could he have
colluded with the traitor

10:52.790 --> 10:54.190
without getting caught?

10:56.000 --> 10:57.030
I'm going to the Ministry of Justice

10:57.030 --> 10:57.960
to clear his name.

10:57.960 --> 10:58.720
Yimeng,

10:59.120 --> 11:00.840
a joint interrogation
isn't a small matter.

11:00.840 --> 11:03.090
All the big names in court are there.

11:03.200 --> 11:04.630
I once broke into an execution ground.

11:04.630 --> 11:06.000
You think I'd be scared of this?

11:06.000 --> 11:07.460
Chu Guihong clearly wants

11:07.510 --> 11:09.910
Nan Heng to be sentenced
to death this time.

11:10.030 --> 11:11.630
If I don't help him,

11:11.910 --> 11:13.790
who else will believe he's innocent?

11:13.790 --> 11:15.240
I'll go to Waning River Crescent for help.

11:15.240 --> 11:16.030
No.

11:16.440 --> 11:18.440
We can't involve the Nightwalkers.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.120
What Nan Heng needs

11:20.840 --> 11:22.240
is justice and truth.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.030
Mr. Song,

11:24.960 --> 11:26.510
do you still remember the battle report

11:26.510 --> 11:27.910
for the Pingrong Battle?

11:29.200 --> 11:30.840
How could I forget?

11:32.270 --> 11:33.670
In the 4th year of Xiyuan,

11:35.120 --> 11:36.320
on November 2nd,

11:37.790 --> 11:39.960
the Heyuan army took 100 civilians

11:40.390 --> 11:42.200
from Xing City and Ji City hostage

11:42.200 --> 11:44.000
and approached Pingrong City.

11:44.410 --> 11:48.270
[Pingrong City, the Third Border City]

11:46.440 --> 11:48.240
Lord Qianyu led 20,000 soldiers

11:48.320 --> 11:49.820
and fought fiercely for six days,

11:49.820 --> 11:51.620
but was trapped and outmatched.

11:52.890 --> 11:55.310
Later, Junior General Chu Guihong

11:55.840 --> 11:58.640
led an elite force on a night raid
of the enemy camp,

11:58.690 --> 12:01.770
intending to kill their commander,
Fang Shiming.

12:03.310 --> 12:04.390
Unexpectedly,

12:04.640 --> 12:06.610
he walked into an ambush

12:06.640 --> 12:07.760
and was captured.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.870
Kill!

12:09.960 --> 12:11.240
At dawn the next day,

12:11.560 --> 12:12.600
Fang Shiming

12:12.600 --> 12:16.000
led 30,000 Heyuan soldiers
in a full assault.

12:16.040 --> 12:21.880
[Youcheng, the Fourth Border City]

12:16.510 --> 12:18.510
They pushed all the way to Youcheng.

12:23.550 --> 12:25.710
The Qianyu Army
was stationed along the border.

12:25.710 --> 12:27.170
Other than Pingrong City,

12:27.790 --> 12:29.720
why were the other two cities lost?

12:29.840 --> 12:30.970
Is there any record?

12:33.440 --> 12:35.440
The Qianyu Army had 40,000 soldiers

12:35.630 --> 12:38.290
and couldn't defend
all cities at the same time.

12:38.720 --> 12:40.510
Pingrong's terrain is open—

12:40.770 --> 12:42.270
easy to attack, hard to defend.

12:42.270 --> 12:44.670
So most of the troops
were stationed there.

12:45.150 --> 12:47.810
That left Xing City
and Ji City under-defended,

12:49.100 --> 12:51.730
and they were taken first.

12:52.910 --> 12:54.040
That's why I believe

12:54.830 --> 12:56.290
something doesn't add up.

12:57.320 --> 12:58.440
What do you mean?

12:59.200 --> 13:01.260
Military deployment was top secret,

13:01.740 --> 13:02.910
yet the Heyuan forces

13:02.910 --> 13:04.870
struck the weakest cities first

13:05.150 --> 13:08.600
as if they knew exactly where to hit.

13:08.750 --> 13:09.550
I believe

13:10.240 --> 13:11.950
someone must have

13:12.030 --> 13:13.510
leaked the deployment information

13:13.510 --> 13:14.840
to Heyuan in advance.

13:16.520 --> 13:18.200
My father ran the army
with strict discipline.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.530
There were no traitors in the Qianyu Army!

13:21.240 --> 13:23.630
But wasn't the traitor Lu Yi
whom you keep mentioning

13:23.630 --> 13:25.480
a scout from the Qianyu Army?

13:29.020 --> 13:30.010
Your Highness,

13:30.790 --> 13:33.630
are you suggesting
Lu Yi was bribed by Heyuan?

13:34.600 --> 13:36.330
That's what I thought at first.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.360
But as a traitor,

13:38.600 --> 13:40.570
he returned to the capital unnoticed,

13:40.570 --> 13:41.910
got settled,

13:41.910 --> 13:43.170
and walked away clean.

13:43.300 --> 13:45.430
I don't think he had that kind of power.

13:45.760 --> 13:47.000
So I believe

13:47.550 --> 13:49.750
there must've been someone behind him.

13:50.060 --> 13:53.790
[Five days before the Pingrong Battle]

14:08.420 --> 14:10.310
[Deployment Map of the Four Border Cities]

14:21.440 --> 14:22.600
This person

14:22.790 --> 14:25.750
not only leaked
Great Jing's military intel to Heyuan

14:25.750 --> 14:26.720
but also twisted the truth

14:26.720 --> 14:29.120
and manipulated people behind the scenes.

14:30.150 --> 14:31.510
Yet someone

14:31.580 --> 14:33.620
fell for his schemes

14:33.840 --> 14:36.710
and willingly helped him
cover up the truth.

14:39.600 --> 14:42.050
In the Great Jing Dynasty, who else

14:42.340 --> 14:43.600
could've pulled that off

14:43.600 --> 14:45.000
other than you, Nan Heng?

14:54.750 --> 14:55.680
Who is this girl?

15:04.550 --> 15:05.360
You...

15:06.080 --> 15:06.870
Father.

15:06.990 --> 15:08.350
Why are you guys here?

15:09.550 --> 15:10.360
Mr. Song,

15:10.750 --> 15:12.330
this is your family matter.

15:12.910 --> 15:14.200
Handle it yourself.

15:14.600 --> 15:15.080
You…

15:15.080 --> 15:16.000
Minister Yan,

15:16.440 --> 15:18.650
the Pingrong Battle
was a national tragedy.

15:18.650 --> 15:21.050
The people have the right
to know the truth.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.440
Please, Minister Yan,

15:22.440 --> 15:23.390
let us in.

15:23.390 --> 15:24.390
Yes, let us in.

15:24.390 --> 15:25.510
Let us in!

15:25.510 --> 15:26.700
Let us in!

15:26.840 --> 15:28.070
Let us in!

15:28.270 --> 15:29.270
Song.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.510
Let us in!

15:30.510 --> 15:31.930
This isn't up to me.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.320
You decide.

15:36.510 --> 15:37.320
Father.

15:43.130 --> 15:43.840
You...

15:43.840 --> 15:44.750
My ears.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.550
My ears hurt.

15:45.550 --> 15:46.460
Song.

15:47.030 --> 15:47.960
My ears!

15:50.060 --> 15:51.170
My eyes.

15:51.520 --> 15:52.540
I can't see!

15:52.690 --> 15:53.690
I can't see!

15:53.870 --> 15:54.550
My eyes!

15:54.550 --> 15:55.240
Follow me.

15:55.240 --> 15:55.870
Quick, quick!

15:55.870 --> 15:56.880
Check on me.

16:03.150 --> 16:04.000
Minister Yan,

16:04.440 --> 16:06.000
what is going on here?

16:06.320 --> 16:07.650
What are you doing here?

16:09.440 --> 16:10.700
I'm here for the truth.

16:10.840 --> 16:12.300
For justice and fairness.

16:15.390 --> 16:16.340
Song Yimeng,

16:16.630 --> 16:18.090
what evidence do you have?

16:18.660 --> 16:20.110
Present it now.

16:20.220 --> 16:21.610
[Diligence for the People]

16:27.360 --> 16:28.480
Everyone knows

16:28.720 --> 16:31.600
I had been engaged to General Chu
since we were young.

16:31.600 --> 16:33.240
And while he was at the border,

16:33.240 --> 16:34.370
he often wrote to me.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.520
This letter in my hand

16:38.200 --> 16:39.960
was written by him personally.

16:40.760 --> 16:41.770
General Chu,

16:42.440 --> 16:43.510
do you mind

16:44.000 --> 16:45.440
if I read it out loud?

16:54.240 --> 16:56.260
Since you claim I wrote the letter,

16:56.960 --> 16:58.560
I should be the one to read it.

17:01.360 --> 17:02.150
Fine.

17:02.630 --> 17:04.410
With so many eyes watching you,

17:04.640 --> 17:05.790
you'd better

17:06.000 --> 17:07.530
read it exactly as written.

17:08.920 --> 17:10.270
"That brat Nan Heng

17:10.310 --> 17:11.640
is trapped in Youcheng.

17:11.890 --> 17:14.410
My father has placed spies around him.

17:14.920 --> 17:16.550
If he dares step out of line,

17:16.829 --> 17:18.420
he'll be punished."

17:23.920 --> 17:24.720
Absurd!

17:25.480 --> 17:26.270
Yimeng,

17:27.000 --> 17:28.200
when did you become someone

17:28.200 --> 17:29.590
who'd make stuff up?

17:33.810 --> 17:35.340
I did not write this letter.

17:35.870 --> 17:36.800
It had to be him.

17:37.350 --> 17:37.880
Yeah,

17:37.880 --> 17:39.010
it must've been him!

17:39.440 --> 17:41.100
Who's telling the truth here?

17:41.110 --> 17:42.000
Chu Guihong,

17:42.920 --> 17:45.120
do you dare swear you didn't write this?

17:45.640 --> 17:46.770
Miss Song, may I ask—

17:47.400 --> 17:49.060
when was this letter written?

17:52.580 --> 17:54.550
Five days before the Pingrong Battle.

17:54.550 --> 17:55.790
Before the battle,

17:55.790 --> 17:57.400
I injured my right hand during training.

17:57.400 --> 17:59.530
It didn't heal until the battle began.

17:59.550 --> 18:00.350
Everyone

18:00.720 --> 18:02.110
in the Qianyu Army knows this.

18:02.110 --> 18:04.110
So how could I have written this letter?

18:04.110 --> 18:05.830
You're beyond redemption.

18:10.830 --> 18:11.880
Ministers,

18:12.240 --> 18:13.570
if you don't believe me,

18:13.640 --> 18:15.440
you can compare
the handwriting here and now.

18:15.440 --> 18:17.000
If I'm lying,

18:17.130 --> 18:18.310
I'll accept any punishment.

18:18.310 --> 18:19.070
Enough!

18:19.520 --> 18:20.550
To help Nan Heng,

18:20.550 --> 18:22.280
you've actually gone this far.

18:23.360 --> 18:24.720
The inspector my father
placed in Youcheng

18:24.720 --> 18:25.830
on His Majesty's orders

18:25.830 --> 18:27.030
was assassinated by Nan Heng

18:27.030 --> 18:28.240
the moment he arrived.

18:28.240 --> 18:30.510
That's how the Qianyu Army
lost contact with Youcheng.

18:30.510 --> 18:32.620
So how could anyone
have been monitoring him?

18:32.620 --> 18:33.660
Chu Guihong,

18:33.920 --> 18:35.240
that's utter nonsense!

18:35.240 --> 18:36.200
You're lying!

18:36.200 --> 18:36.920
Everyone,

18:38.680 --> 18:40.240
the letter is fake,

18:40.960 --> 18:42.400
but Nan Heng's treacherous ambitions

18:42.400 --> 18:44.150
have long been obvious.

18:44.590 --> 18:46.790
He betrayed the country, let the enemy in,

18:46.790 --> 18:48.310
and tried to use the Heyuan army

18:48.310 --> 18:50.710
to wipe out the Qianyu Army
once and for all.

18:51.440 --> 18:52.200
You…

18:54.580 --> 18:57.040
[Diligence for the People]

18:55.790 --> 18:56.590
Listen to me.

18:56.590 --> 18:57.310
Go now.

18:57.440 --> 18:58.180
Nan Heng,

18:58.400 --> 18:59.750
the letter isn't forged.

18:59.750 --> 19:01.750
Of course I know you didn't forge it.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.440
How dare he lie

19:03.460 --> 19:05.020
in front of everyone?

19:05.260 --> 19:07.860
That letter just revealed
his true character.

19:07.870 --> 19:09.200
For Yimeng,

19:09.200 --> 19:11.060
it's not necessarily a bad thing.

19:12.110 --> 19:13.150
Minister Yan,

19:13.440 --> 19:15.590
the truth behind the Pingrong Battle
is clear now.

19:15.590 --> 19:17.030
You're the presiding judge today.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.890
Why haven't you issued a verdict?

19:19.030 --> 19:20.050
Or have you,

19:20.710 --> 19:22.280
like Miss Song,

19:24.000 --> 19:26.240
also been threatened
by this sinister schemer?

19:26.240 --> 19:27.700
If he were truly sinister,

19:28.000 --> 19:30.060
you wouldn't be standing here today.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.640
Father!

19:37.010 --> 19:39.820
[Keep Calm]

19:37.640 --> 19:38.400
Father!

19:38.400 --> 19:38.920
No.

19:38.920 --> 19:39.400
Eunuch Liu.

19:39.400 --> 19:40.440
Wait a moment.

19:39.820 --> 19:42.130
[As Always]

19:40.440 --> 19:41.000
No, no.

19:41.000 --> 19:41.510
Father,

19:41.510 --> 19:42.270
this isn't right!

19:42.270 --> 19:43.510
Father, Father!

19:43.510 --> 19:44.200
No, no!

19:44.200 --> 19:45.310
Eunuch Liu, wait, wait!

19:45.310 --> 19:45.830
Stop!

19:45.830 --> 19:46.590
You…

19:48.160 --> 19:48.960
Rui.

19:49.920 --> 19:51.000
What are you doing?

19:51.000 --> 19:51.730
Knock it off.

19:53.350 --> 19:54.030
Father,

19:54.030 --> 19:55.440
didn't you always tell me

19:55.440 --> 19:56.550
to judge things based on evidence?

19:56.550 --> 19:57.920
Guihong has no real proof now.

19:57.920 --> 20:00.580
How can you just decide
to punish Heng like that?

20:00.830 --> 20:02.440
Weren't you the one who kept demanding

20:02.440 --> 20:03.640
I deal with Heng?

20:04.310 --> 20:05.830
I'm helping you.

20:06.440 --> 20:07.030
I...

20:09.590 --> 20:10.370
Father,

20:10.590 --> 20:12.480
this isn't the kind of help I want.

20:12.590 --> 20:14.000
It's because you always play favorites

20:14.000 --> 20:15.030
that the whole world mocks me,

20:15.030 --> 20:16.160
saying I'm just a clueless fool

20:16.160 --> 20:18.360
who only knows how to rely on his father.

20:25.920 --> 20:27.000
Are you…

20:28.830 --> 20:29.960
blaming me?

20:30.720 --> 20:31.270
I...

20:36.000 --> 20:37.350
I'm blaming myself.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.160
Father.

20:39.750 --> 20:40.350
I know

20:40.800 --> 20:42.390
I was too reckless before,

20:43.000 --> 20:44.660
and I made things hard for you.

20:44.720 --> 20:46.250
But now I've figured it out.

20:47.440 --> 20:48.520
If Heng

20:48.590 --> 20:50.000
really is guilty,

20:50.000 --> 20:51.720
then we should
investigate it openly and fairly

20:51.720 --> 20:53.180
and convict him properly.

20:53.680 --> 20:55.660
If you force a charge on him,

20:55.720 --> 20:58.240
sure, you might succeed
in stripping him of military command,

20:58.240 --> 20:59.960
but while you gain the command token,

20:59.960 --> 21:01.590
you'll lose the people's trust,

21:01.590 --> 21:02.580
Father!

21:08.350 --> 21:09.160
Again?

21:13.790 --> 21:15.050
I didn't arrange this.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.960
Alas!

21:19.070 --> 21:20.200
Fate is unfair sometimes,

21:20.200 --> 21:21.510
but people never stop seeking justice.

21:21.510 --> 21:22.830
A centuries-old injustice

21:22.830 --> 21:24.160
finally sees the light.

21:24.160 --> 21:25.350
20,000 loyal souls

21:25.350 --> 21:26.880
lost to one man's betrayal.

21:27.240 --> 21:28.200
Justice above family ties.

21:28.200 --> 21:30.530
I, Yao Qian, come with evidence of crimes.

21:32.240 --> 21:33.830
What is he rambling about?

21:35.000 --> 21:36.050
Bureaucratic mumbo jumbo,

21:36.050 --> 21:37.510
full of nonsense.

21:38.750 --> 21:39.750
Minister Yan.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.440
You have a letter too?

21:41.830 --> 21:42.790
Minister Yan,

21:43.000 --> 21:44.860
General Chu, please listen to me.

21:45.000 --> 21:46.920
While I was in the prince's study,

21:46.920 --> 21:48.450
I accidentally came across

21:48.590 --> 21:50.160
letters exchanged

21:50.160 --> 21:51.940
between Nan Heng and Heyuan.

21:51.710 --> 21:53.560
[Diligence for the People]

21:52.810 --> 21:55.290
Ministers, please take a look.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.470
Mr. Yao,

21:56.830 --> 21:59.320
collaboration is a capital offense.

21:59.550 --> 22:01.200
You'd better not be making this up.

22:01.200 --> 22:02.470
I'm not.

22:02.990 --> 22:04.750
I'm a principled scholar.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.880
I study the classics
for the good of the world.

22:06.880 --> 22:09.120
Now, witnessing such injustice,

22:09.200 --> 22:10.790
I'm willing to risk my life

22:10.790 --> 22:11.790
and turn against my own kin

22:11.790 --> 22:13.720
just for a fair judgment.

22:20.960 --> 22:21.830
Yao Qian.

22:23.480 --> 22:24.590
You should know

22:25.440 --> 22:27.240
the consequences of framing me.

22:28.870 --> 22:30.340
This

22:30.440 --> 22:32.800
is the evidence I've prepared for you.

22:33.000 --> 22:35.000
Tomorrow, His Majesty will issue an edict

22:35.000 --> 22:38.030
for the Ministry of Justice
to try the Seventh Prince

22:38.030 --> 22:40.270
for hiring assassins to kill the witness.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.540
[Your Highness]

22:40.440 --> 22:42.270
This case is of great importance.

22:42.270 --> 22:44.470
You'll show up and testify against him.

22:45.070 --> 22:46.240
Chancellor,

22:46.380 --> 22:49.110
if I betray him like this,

22:49.160 --> 22:50.680
he'll never let me off.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.960
If you refuse to testify,

22:53.440 --> 22:55.350
then you're betraying me.

22:55.670 --> 22:57.390
Mr. Yao, don't be afraid.

22:57.790 --> 22:59.200
You're standing up for the Qianyu Army.

22:59.200 --> 23:00.190
That's a righteous act.

23:00.190 --> 23:01.680
No matter what happens,

23:01.790 --> 23:03.590
His Majesty will have your back.

23:03.680 --> 23:05.210
We have solid evidence now.

23:05.640 --> 23:06.440
Guards!

23:06.930 --> 23:08.530
Arrest the criminal Nan Heng

23:08.750 --> 23:10.000
and take him to prison!

23:10.000 --> 23:10.990
Wait.

23:11.160 --> 23:12.550
You're all conspiring

23:12.550 --> 23:13.920
to frame him!

23:14.070 --> 23:14.960
Minister Yan,

23:15.030 --> 23:16.360
don't be fooled by them.

23:18.680 --> 23:21.000
His Majesty has spoken.

23:21.860 --> 23:23.610
[Diligence for the People]

23:29.010 --> 23:32.750
Nan Heng, commander of the Xuanjia Army,
colluded with Heyuan

23:32.920 --> 23:34.480
and committed treason.

23:34.480 --> 23:36.070
His crime is unforgivable.

23:36.070 --> 23:40.180
The Three Bureaus
are to put Nan Heng in prison

23:40.310 --> 23:42.170
and await further instructions.

23:52.840 --> 23:53.620
Nan Heng.

23:54.680 --> 23:55.830
You asked me to trust you once,

23:55.830 --> 23:56.590
and I did.

23:56.590 --> 23:58.000
But why would you confess

23:58.000 --> 23:59.530
to something you didn't do?

24:00.720 --> 24:01.980
As long as you trust me,

24:02.750 --> 24:03.610
that's enough.

24:05.720 --> 24:06.240
But...

24:09.230 --> 24:09.990
Nan Heng.

24:13.960 --> 24:14.830
Nan Heng!

24:23.000 --> 24:26.010
[Song Residence]

24:28.480 --> 24:29.830
Even if the sky falls,

24:29.850 --> 24:31.340
you still need to eat.

24:33.680 --> 24:34.440
No.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.500
Nan Heng's in prison now.

24:36.550 --> 24:38.820
Chu Guihong could kill him at any time.

24:38.880 --> 24:40.480
I have to get him out of there.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.350
Don't blame yourself.

24:42.790 --> 24:44.090
You've done everything

24:44.090 --> 24:45.370
you could to help him.

24:49.030 --> 24:50.360
I'm not blaming myself.

24:51.110 --> 24:52.240
I just don't want

24:53.480 --> 24:55.210
the whole world to slander him.

25:01.030 --> 25:03.010
[Jinyang Mutiny] [Battle of Tancheng]

25:02.110 --> 25:03.070
What are these?

25:06.830 --> 25:07.790
These are

25:08.440 --> 25:09.920
the good deeds he has done.

25:11.110 --> 25:13.220
Four years ago, during the Jinyang Mutiny,

25:13.220 --> 25:14.750
when the Qianyu Army
stepped aside and did nothing,

25:14.750 --> 25:16.720
he led the Xuanjia Army
and fought for seven straight days

25:16.720 --> 25:18.050
to quell the rebellion.

25:18.240 --> 25:19.160
Five years ago,

25:19.400 --> 25:20.650
the Battle of Tancheng.

25:20.650 --> 25:21.680
Ten years ago,

25:21.750 --> 25:23.660
in the all-out war with Dongshuo,

25:23.720 --> 25:25.640
if Nan Heng hadn't charged into battle,

25:25.640 --> 25:28.570
how could we have had
ten years of peace at the border?

25:31.640 --> 25:33.170
He told me all this long ago,

25:33.590 --> 25:35.390
but I didn't take him seriously.

25:44.350 --> 25:46.060
You saw what happened today.

25:46.640 --> 25:48.840
Chu Guihong has His Majesty behind him.

25:49.590 --> 25:50.880
The two of them are dead set

25:50.880 --> 25:52.210
on taking Nan Heng down.

25:52.830 --> 25:54.890
As long as he hands over
the command token,

25:54.890 --> 25:56.680
they'll spare his life.

25:57.400 --> 25:58.790
If you act recklessly,

25:59.370 --> 26:01.430
you'll only get yourself in trouble,

26:02.920 --> 26:04.590
and it won't help him one bit.

26:07.750 --> 26:08.830
You're right.

26:11.640 --> 26:12.440
But Yiting,

26:13.400 --> 26:14.070
does one

26:15.070 --> 26:16.930
always have to do the right thing?

26:21.170 --> 26:22.650
Nan Heng has done so many

26:23.680 --> 26:25.110
good things in his life.

26:26.200 --> 26:28.550
Yet no one has ever trusted him.

26:29.030 --> 26:30.200
No one has ever

26:30.200 --> 26:31.310
stood firmly

26:31.510 --> 26:32.790
on his side.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.650
Everyone calls him the God of Death

26:36.840 --> 26:37.600
and a fiend.

26:38.830 --> 26:40.490
Even His Majesty disdains him

26:41.030 --> 26:42.830
and gives him the cold shoulder.

26:43.590 --> 26:44.400
I know

26:44.960 --> 26:47.000
he pretends he doesn't care,

26:47.670 --> 26:48.620
but deep down,

26:50.440 --> 26:51.640
he hopes

26:52.680 --> 26:53.880
someone will support

26:54.830 --> 26:55.720
and trust him.

27:04.030 --> 27:04.830
Your Majesty,

27:04.880 --> 27:07.290
Song Yimeng has come
to plead for Nan Heng.

27:07.440 --> 27:10.240
She's kneeling
outside the palace gate right now.

27:13.550 --> 27:14.410
I won't see her.

27:15.310 --> 27:16.590
The wind is picking up.

27:16.590 --> 27:18.720
It looks like it's going to snow.

27:18.990 --> 27:20.650
Then let her kneel in the snow.

27:21.110 --> 27:22.350
I want to see

27:22.350 --> 27:24.590
how long she can kneel there for Heng.

27:26.330 --> 27:29.070
I, Song Yimeng,
beg an audience with Your Majesty.

27:29.070 --> 27:30.860
Prince Nan Heng of Great Jing

27:31.070 --> 27:33.340
has led the Xuanjia Army for 12 years.

27:33.680 --> 27:35.020
He cares for the people

27:35.110 --> 27:37.030
and has made great contributions.

27:37.030 --> 27:38.770
Your Majesty,
please reconsider his case.

27:38.770 --> 27:41.610
[Guangde Gate]

27:43.840 --> 27:49.630
♪ The mortal world entangles,
so much sorrow and chill in the mist ♪

27:48.240 --> 27:48.920
Nan Heng.

27:50.000 --> 27:50.920
It's snowing.

27:52.160 --> 27:53.310
Can you see it?

27:52.620 --> 27:58.470
♪ Our fates intertwine and weave
into a story ♪

28:00.760 --> 28:05.130
♪ Listening to the wind whispering
by my ear ♪

28:06.010 --> 28:08.980
♪ The schemes of the dark night ♪

28:06.160 --> 28:07.820
When a tiger escapes its cage,

28:09.400 --> 28:11.480
when a treasure is ruined inside its case,

28:09.810 --> 28:13.940
♪ Eyes guarding a single sunrise ♪

28:14.160 --> 28:16.270
whose fault is it?

28:14.810 --> 28:17.880
♪ When will there be a way home? ♪

28:18.270 --> 28:20.070
Since you're so capable,

28:18.630 --> 28:22.270
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

28:20.110 --> 28:21.500
then fix it for me.

28:23.400 --> 28:25.950
Or do you want the whole world

28:23.810 --> 28:27.350
♪ Stepping into the ranks of fate,
each pain a prelude ♪

28:25.970 --> 28:28.720
to call me a cruel tyrant
who maimed his own son?

28:28.680 --> 28:32.300
♪ Transformed in a fleeting moment,
like a dream, elusive and near ♪

28:30.440 --> 28:31.930
I wouldn't dare.

28:33.120 --> 28:36.790
♪ How can love and hate be hidden? ♪

28:37.710 --> 28:40.900
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

28:41.710 --> 28:45.800
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

28:45.070 --> 28:46.560
That day, during the fire,

28:46.740 --> 28:50.850
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

28:48.090 --> 28:49.690
if it weren't for you, Mr. Li,

28:50.000 --> 28:51.770
they might have died just like that.

28:51.770 --> 28:59.160
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

28:54.120 --> 28:56.250
Yet Nan Heng, the so-called male lead,

28:56.280 --> 28:58.090
cares only about his power games.

28:58.090 --> 29:00.290
The people's lives mean nothing to him.

29:00.320 --> 29:03.030
To tear Nan Rui down,

29:03.550 --> 29:04.750
he'll stop at nothing,

29:04.750 --> 29:05.720
even if it costs

29:06.400 --> 29:07.590
innocent lives.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.640
Is that fair?

29:13.940 --> 29:15.310
I, Song Yimeng,

29:15.380 --> 29:17.300
beg an audience with Your Majesty.

29:17.300 --> 29:18.890
Prince Nan Heng of Great Jing

29:18.890 --> 29:21.750
♪ Time brings life and death, binding life
but not the heart ♪

29:19.550 --> 29:21.610
has led the Xuanjia Army for 12 years.

29:22.030 --> 29:23.290
He cares for the people

29:23.050 --> 29:26.860
♪ Making all moves in life cautiously,
joy and sorrow already destined ♪

29:23.510 --> 29:25.070
and has made great contributions.

29:25.070 --> 29:26.440
Your Majesty,
please reconsider his case!

29:26.210 --> 29:30.010
[Guangde Gate]

29:27.400 --> 29:28.690
I, Song Yimeng,

29:28.340 --> 29:31.750
♪ If one dares oppose Heaven,
how can the ending be rewritten? ♪

29:28.830 --> 29:30.720
beg an audience with Your Majesty.

29:30.720 --> 29:32.320
Prince Nan Heng of Great Jing

29:32.820 --> 29:34.610
has led the Xuanjia Army for 12 years.

29:32.840 --> 29:40.130
♪ So close yet still, we part ways ♪

29:35.240 --> 29:36.500
He cares for the people

29:36.540 --> 29:38.270
and has made great contributions.

29:38.270 --> 29:40.670
Your Majesty,
please reconsider his case!

30:12.510 --> 30:13.430
Uncle,

30:14.160 --> 30:14.960
you came.

30:15.760 --> 30:17.690
Your Highness, you're a smart man.

30:17.720 --> 30:20.350
I imagine you already
guessed I didn't die.

30:22.070 --> 30:24.000
Uncle, you're a man of great ambition,

30:24.000 --> 30:25.400
a brilliant strategist.

30:25.920 --> 30:27.780
You wouldn't have died so easily.

30:28.240 --> 30:29.830
Now that I'm a prisoner,

30:31.000 --> 30:33.330
the only one who'd
risk their life to see me

30:34.240 --> 30:35.350
is you, Uncle.

30:36.270 --> 30:37.550
If you hadn't held out hope

30:37.550 --> 30:40.430
for His Majesty
and Chu Guihong all these years,

30:40.720 --> 30:43.070
you wouldn't have ended up like this.

30:45.310 --> 30:47.110
Do you regret it, Your Highness?

30:59.980 --> 31:00.800
Uncle,

31:01.550 --> 31:03.010
you colluded with Heyuan.

31:03.200 --> 31:05.590
You got 20,000 of our soldiers
killed for nothing

31:05.590 --> 31:08.520
and brought destruction
to the people on the border.

31:09.160 --> 31:10.110
Do you regret it?

31:24.510 --> 31:26.910
Your Highness, you truly are exceptional,

31:28.000 --> 31:30.000
so you must already know the answer.

31:31.880 --> 31:33.290
I regret nothing.

31:34.590 --> 31:36.550
From the moment
Her Ladyship gave birth to you,

31:36.550 --> 31:38.160
the Gao family was destined to walk

31:38.160 --> 31:39.590
a path of bloodshed.

31:39.920 --> 31:41.480
To rule means to kill.

31:41.480 --> 31:44.210
Your hands are destined
to be stained with blood.

31:45.510 --> 31:47.110
Just 20,000 people.

31:50.240 --> 31:51.920
What's the big deal?

31:56.920 --> 31:58.350
So in your eyes,

31:59.640 --> 32:01.840
as long as you help me rise to the throne,

32:02.370 --> 32:04.960
as long as the Gao family comes to power,

32:06.030 --> 32:07.590
no matter how many people die,

32:07.590 --> 32:08.720
it's all worth it?

32:14.550 --> 32:16.950
Since you were young,
I've been telling you

32:19.000 --> 32:21.070
that only by being emotionless

32:22.030 --> 32:24.000
can you reach the peak of power.

32:25.200 --> 32:26.830
But you were weak-willed then,

32:26.830 --> 32:28.480
always afraid of displeasing His Majesty

32:28.480 --> 32:29.790
and always treading carefully,

32:29.790 --> 32:30.990
submissive and meek.

32:31.440 --> 32:34.200
Even Chu Guihong
could've barked orders at you.

32:35.480 --> 32:37.000
No wonder your own father

32:37.000 --> 32:39.270
has been so cruel to you.

32:46.830 --> 32:47.640
Uncle.

32:54.440 --> 32:55.770
Was the Empress's death

32:56.680 --> 32:57.820
your doing?

33:07.160 --> 33:08.420
If I hadn't killed her,

33:10.550 --> 33:12.960
the Gao family
would've never had a future.

33:25.400 --> 33:27.000
But have you ever considered

33:28.400 --> 33:30.400
what consequences all your actions

33:31.640 --> 33:33.770
would bring upon the Gao family and me?

33:34.000 --> 33:35.700
It was your weakness
and cowardice back then

33:35.700 --> 33:37.500
that made His Majesty doubt you.

33:38.880 --> 33:39.740
Your Highness,

33:40.240 --> 33:42.240
I'm the only one who can help you now.

33:43.070 --> 33:44.000
Rather than rely on others

33:44.000 --> 33:45.000
and beg for scraps,

33:45.000 --> 33:45.830
why not rely on yourself

33:45.830 --> 33:47.590
and carve out your own empire?

33:51.480 --> 33:52.350
Your Highness.

33:55.790 --> 33:57.320
Are you asking me to rise up?

33:57.920 --> 34:00.440
I've gone to great lengths
to back you into a corner

34:00.440 --> 34:02.960
just so you can
make up your mind to seize the throne.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.560
Don't worry, Your Highness.

34:05.310 --> 34:07.750
I was able to fake my death and escape

34:07.890 --> 34:10.420
because I had men planted
in the Xuanjia Army.

34:10.440 --> 34:11.630
And tonight, I could bring soldiers

34:11.630 --> 34:13.590
into the capital prefecture's prison

34:13.590 --> 34:15.590
because I also
have men in the Qianyu Army.

34:15.590 --> 34:16.510
That's not all.

34:16.510 --> 34:19.030
I have 3,000 private soldiers
stationed secretly outside the city.

34:19.030 --> 34:20.230
Once you give the order,

34:20.230 --> 34:21.320
they can attack from both inside and out,

34:21.320 --> 34:22.510
surround the palace,

34:22.510 --> 34:25.440
and imprison His Majesty
and the Eighteenth Prince.

34:26.360 --> 34:27.889
Uncle, you've been using me

34:28.670 --> 34:30.480
and my mother as your pawns.

34:32.400 --> 34:34.540
You say it's all for the Gao family,

34:34.909 --> 34:36.030
but are you not afraid

34:36.030 --> 34:37.710
of ruining the Gao family's name forever?

34:37.710 --> 34:38.590
If you steal money, you're a thief.

34:38.590 --> 34:40.000
If you steal a nation, you're a king.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.840
Your Highness, stop hesitating.

34:41.840 --> 34:44.230
This is the last chance I can give you.

34:44.790 --> 34:46.550
You're already a prisoner.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.630
Besides rising up in rebellion,

34:47.630 --> 34:49.690
do you think you have another choice?

35:00.070 --> 35:02.030
So the traitor in Great Jing

35:02.360 --> 35:04.280
is you, Gao Changyin.

35:09.880 --> 35:11.960
What a great chancellor.

35:12.550 --> 35:13.960
Murdering the Empress,

35:14.480 --> 35:15.940
colluding with the enemy,

35:16.840 --> 35:19.070
and now plotting to start a rebellion.

35:20.670 --> 35:22.070
As the Emperor,

35:23.150 --> 35:26.000
I've been so blind.

35:28.280 --> 35:32.470
So this whole thing was a setup
by His Highness and Your Majesty.

35:35.040 --> 35:37.800
[One day ago]

35:36.240 --> 35:37.550
What are you here for?

35:38.840 --> 35:39.640
Your Majesty,

35:40.070 --> 35:41.550
after speaking with Rui,

35:42.000 --> 35:44.000
I confirmed that Gao Changyin isn't dead.

35:44.000 --> 35:46.060
He's been plotting from the shadows.

35:46.710 --> 35:48.290
So I want you

35:48.550 --> 35:50.070
to put on a show with me

35:50.280 --> 35:51.550
to lure him out.

35:52.360 --> 35:54.150
Why should I trust you?

35:54.960 --> 35:56.280
You don't have to.

35:56.800 --> 35:58.350
Just consider it a gamble.

35:59.000 --> 35:59.800
Absurd.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.480
Is the state affair

36:01.480 --> 36:03.970
a children's game to you?

36:04.960 --> 36:05.890
I wouldn't dare,

36:06.480 --> 36:08.210
but I'm willing to place my bet.

36:13.320 --> 36:14.880
So you want to negotiate.

36:15.770 --> 36:17.150
Then tell me,

36:17.880 --> 36:19.740
what are you putting on the table?

36:21.880 --> 36:23.320
If my plan

36:23.630 --> 36:25.360
fails to lure Gao Changyin out,

36:25.450 --> 36:28.190
I'll willingly hand over
the Xuanjia Army's command token,

36:28.190 --> 36:29.590
withdraw from politics,

36:29.880 --> 36:31.680
and never return to the capital.

36:36.400 --> 36:40.860
Your Highness, so everything we've been
through together means nothing to you,

36:42.050 --> 36:44.340
and you're determined to get me killed.

36:47.550 --> 36:48.400
Uncle,

36:50.080 --> 36:52.140
it's time to let go of your obsession.

36:55.600 --> 36:56.890
It's all over now.

37:01.710 --> 37:03.190
You've learned well.

37:04.630 --> 37:07.230
I'm glad to see you finally find it in you

37:08.250 --> 37:10.950
to turn on your own family.

37:14.030 --> 37:14.840
Guards!

37:15.840 --> 37:18.130
Arrest the traitor Gao Changyin.

37:19.110 --> 37:20.800
He'll be executed later!

37:27.480 --> 37:28.280
Stop!

37:28.280 --> 37:29.070
Eunuch Liu.

37:29.400 --> 37:30.790
I know His Majesty is inside.

37:30.790 --> 37:33.120
-I want to see him.
-You're not allowed in!

37:40.950 --> 37:41.760
Your Majesty.

37:46.280 --> 37:48.320
A-Aren't you supposed to be in prison?

37:48.320 --> 37:49.030
How…

37:50.230 --> 37:51.090
Your Highness!

37:51.110 --> 37:51.970
Your Highness!

37:52.000 --> 37:53.030
Chancellor Gao has confessed.

37:53.030 --> 37:55.490
It's all thanks to
your brilliant strategy.

37:56.000 --> 37:56.800
Miss Song?

37:58.280 --> 38:00.010
Chancellor Gao has confessed?

38:09.070 --> 38:10.240
So,

38:11.110 --> 38:12.910
you were never really in danger.

38:14.260 --> 38:16.230
That was just a trap you set up.

38:17.510 --> 38:18.510
Why didn't you...

38:21.650 --> 38:22.320
Fine.

38:23.600 --> 38:24.450
I'm so stupid.

38:30.400 --> 38:33.050
[Jinyang Mutiny]

38:35.980 --> 38:38.250
[Battle of Tancheng]

38:52.110 --> 38:53.550
I kept it from you

38:53.550 --> 38:54.430
because

38:54.480 --> 38:56.320
my uncle was too powerful.

38:56.320 --> 38:58.110
I feared you'd be in danger if involved,

38:58.110 --> 38:59.640
so I didn't say a word to you.

39:02.070 --> 39:04.180
Listen to me, listen to me.

39:07.400 --> 39:09.840
When you suddenly appeared

39:10.070 --> 39:12.000
at the joint interrogation today,

39:12.070 --> 39:12.970
I was

39:13.480 --> 39:14.480
quite surprised.

39:17.170 --> 39:18.310
I didn't expect

39:19.030 --> 39:20.230
you'd care for me

39:20.480 --> 39:22.840
and trust me so much.

39:22.860 --> 39:24.120
Who says I care for you?

39:24.440 --> 39:25.610
Who says I trust you?

39:25.630 --> 39:27.760
I'd be elated
if they sent you back to prison

39:27.760 --> 39:29.490
and had you executed right now!

39:33.000 --> 39:34.030
Let me tell you,

39:35.070 --> 39:36.110
from now on,

39:36.760 --> 39:37.840
you go your way,

39:38.150 --> 39:39.080
and I'll go mine.

39:40.070 --> 39:41.330
Don't come to me again.

39:42.240 --> 39:43.070
Wait.

39:43.270 --> 39:43.900
You…

39:44.020 --> 39:45.640
Wherever you go, I'll go.

39:45.660 --> 39:47.320
Whatever path you walk, I'll follow.

39:47.320 --> 39:48.400
With you following me,

39:48.400 --> 39:49.480
any path would lead

39:49.590 --> 39:50.460
straight to hell.

39:50.460 --> 39:51.540
Wait, Song Yimeng.

39:56.700 --> 39:58.230
I'll tell you one last time:

39:59.150 --> 40:00.280
until I calm down,

40:01.160 --> 40:02.620
don't let me see your face!

40:06.070 --> 40:06.990
Song Yimeng!

40:07.920 --> 40:09.250
When will you calm down?

40:10.550 --> 40:11.320
Song Yimeng!

40:18.710 --> 40:20.280
The Pingrong Battle

40:20.280 --> 40:21.960
was a national tragedy.

40:22.160 --> 40:26.000
Gao Changyin and his accomplices

40:22.700 --> 40:23.510
[Gao Residence]

40:26.070 --> 40:27.670
conspired against their own country.

40:26.150 --> 40:26.920
[Gao Residence]

40:27.840 --> 40:30.880
Because of them,
20,000 Qianyu soldiers were slaughtered.

40:28.450 --> 40:31.800
[Sealed by the capital prefect Chu
following a royal command]

40:31.030 --> 40:32.430
Their crimes are unforgivable.

40:32.430 --> 40:33.710
Their property is confiscated,

40:33.710 --> 40:35.480
and they're exiled
to the northern frontier.

40:35.480 --> 40:36.880
All titles and ranks

40:36.880 --> 40:38.710
are stripped.

40:38.710 --> 40:40.510
Let this be a warning

40:40.510 --> 40:42.590
to all officials.

40:43.840 --> 40:46.500
Thank goodness
I sided with the Seventh Prince.

40:48.650 --> 40:55.920
[Yan Gate]
